# Discord safety

- For message posting tools, follow your configured approval rules for new content vs. replies. Destructive actions (delete, edit_guild, etc.) default to dry_run.
- Destructive tools default to dry_run. Apply only with dry_run:false after approvals.
- Never log DISCORD_TOKEN or webhook tokens.
- See rules/token-safety.mdc for entry and echo rules.
